WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.830
empowerment is an intrinsic motivation
that captures how much an agent is in

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:09.550
control of the world it can itself
perceive so an agent wants to be

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:14.339
empowered because it wants to have many
options that lead to different outcomes

00:00:14.339 --> 00:00:20.620
choices that are actually meaningful and
affecting the world around it and as

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:27.070
such empowerment is intrinsically linked
to the agency of an agent to its sense

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:32.170
of self-preservation to the level of
causal efficacy it has in the world and

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:36.280
thereby it differs from these
arbitrarily assigned functions and

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:40.600
machine learning it is something that is
it's a kernel of the motivation of the

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:45.900
agent and not just some instrumental
goal but rather a basis that governs all

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:50.970
motivations and behavior of the agent
and can actually be used to create

00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:55.530
specific sub goals for the agent itself

